WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.400
And Fox

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:00.867
News has

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.902
agreed to pay an enormous

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.337
a historic price

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:06.473
for broadcasting conspiracy theories

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:07.974
about the 2020 election.

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:08.541
The network

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:09.976
reaching a last minute settlement

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:11.611
with Dominion voting systems

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:14.280
for more than $787 million.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.116
They struck the right agreement

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:17.050
that struck the agreement

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.318
I should say right before

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:19.919
right before the defamation

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.421
trial was about to begin.

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:22.255
Dominion's lawyers

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:23.189
say it's a victory

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:25.291
for truth and democracy.

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:26.426
Dominion tells CNN

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:27.994
that the deal does not require

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:29.896
Fox News anchors to go on air

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:31.498
and tell viewers that they lied.

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:33.233
Here's what Fox said in a statement.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:35.402
When the news broke

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:38.238
I do have a statement from Fox, Neil.

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:39.372
We are pleased to have reached

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:40.073
a settlement

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:40.640
of our dispute

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.142
with Dominion Voting Systems.

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:44.010
We acknowledge the court's rulings

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.079
finding certain claims about Dominion

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.113
to be false.

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.348
This settlement reflects Fox's

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:49.549
continued commitment

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.785
to the highest journalistic standards.

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:53.420
We just want to give you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.455
now a small sample of the broadcast

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:57.757
that got Fox News broadcasts

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.459
that got Fox News in trouble. Here it is,

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:01.861
Sidney.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:03.930
We talked about the Dominion software.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.331
I know that there were

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:07.067
voting irregularities.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.301
Tell me about that.

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:09.869
Electronic voting machines

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:12.405
didn't allow people to vote, apparently,

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.273
and that whatever

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.808
you think of it, the cause of it,

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:16.843
it shakes people's faith in the system

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:19.279
that is an actual threat to democracy.

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:20.613
And this morning,

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.348
we're hearing from the CEO of Dominion

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:22.982
Voting Systems.

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:23.950
Watch this

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:26.753
There was an acknowledgment

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:27.754
and certainly it's not

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.756
the way I wrote it.

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:32.659
And I had some conversations with

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:34.527
our team.

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:37.497
My co-founder and I

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:39.432
and at the end of the day,

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:40.133
the court system

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.469
really is about accountability.

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:44.270
We feel we got it

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:47.607
and all of the facts

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:48.808
that we had discovered

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:49.909
during the case

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:52.378
had already come to light.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:53.413
Joining us now,

00:01:53.413 --> 00:01:55.381
lead counsel for Dominion, Justin Nelson.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:55.715
Justin,

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:56.516
thank you so much

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:57.750
for your time this morning.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:58.651
Thank you. Good morning.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:01.955
Hi.
Good morning.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.990
I think one of the big questions

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:04.824
this morning is sort of

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:06.893
how do you put a price tag on

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:09.095
trust in US democracy? Right.

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:10.330
You can't put a price on that,

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.065
as one of our colleagues writes on CNN

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:12.832
this morning.

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:14.434
Was this about money for Dominion

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:16.836
or was this about truth?

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:20.473
Well, I think it was really our two

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:22.275
goals were accountability.

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:25.044
And to get compensation for this

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:26.746
massive amount of harm

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:28.214
that occurred to the company.

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:29.249
And I think we achieved

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:32.752
both on the truth, on the accountability.

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:34.621
Over the past few months,

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:37.223
you've seen this mountain of evidence

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:38.324
that has been revealed

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:40.260
and texts and emails

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.228
that really show that, in fact,

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:44.731
Fox knew Fox knew that it was lies.

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:47.167
And the statement that Fox released

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.501
yesterday acknowledged

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:50.003
the court's order

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:51.871
that called these false.

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:54.240
This was the first time

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.943
that a court has held

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:58.845
that the election lies

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:00.813
were, in fact, lies.

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:03.116
And this was the first time that someone

00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:04.951
has been held accountable

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:05.752
in the form

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:07.854
of a nearly $800 million payment

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:08.755
for that.

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:10.423
It is also, of course,

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:11.958
a civil litigation,

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:14.727
and it's about making my client whole.

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:16.729
And although this does not make my client

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:19.499
a whole, it is a step in that direction.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:23.703
And instead of going for years to appeal

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:25.305
and to a verdict,

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:27.607
we got an $800 million settlement,

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:29.442
nearly $800 million settlement.

00:03:29.442 --> 00:03:30.810
And we're proud of what we did.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.945
And we do think it's a victory

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:34.047
both for truth and for accountability.

00:03:34.047 --> 00:03:34.747
Let's talk a little bit

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:36.282
more about that, Justin,

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:37.483
because in the statement,

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:40.053
I mean, Fox says this is just part of it.

00:03:40.253 --> 00:03:41.087
We acknowledge

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:41.521
the court's

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:42.622
rulings

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:43.890
finding certain claims

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.391
about Dominion to be false.

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:46.659
They didn't exactly say that,

00:03:46.659 --> 00:03:47.760
that they lied.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:48.895
And there is

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:50.396
among the public,

00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:51.631
there is a feeling

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:53.132
that it may have been better.

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:55.201
Justin, for the Fox News anchors

00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:58.304
and their leaders or management

00:03:58.304 --> 00:03:59.706
to take the stand,

00:03:59.706 --> 00:04:01.741
to acknowledge the lies publicly

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:02.742
that that would have sent

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:03.610
a stronger message.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.477
What do you say to that?

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.514
Well, I would say that

00:04:08.514 --> 00:04:09.916
there was that acknowledgment.

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:11.017
And I would also say

00:04:11.017 --> 00:04:13.019
that in the civil litigation system,

00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:15.622
we could have gotten a ten 20 billion

00:04:15.622 --> 00:04:17.890
you name the billion dollar award,

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:18.992
and they still wouldn't

00:04:18.992 --> 00:04:20.994
have had to apologize or to go on air

00:04:20.994 --> 00:04:22.695
to say that they were wrong.

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:24.030
What we can do in a civil

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.231
litigation system

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:26.633
is to bring accountability

00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:28.468
by exposing the truth

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:32.105
and by having compensation for the harm

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:32.772
that occurred.

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:33.539
And on that,

00:04:33.539 --> 00:04:36.509
we accomplish both by a wide margin.

00:04:36.776 --> 00:04:38.011
Would you have preferred

00:04:38.011 --> 00:04:39.512
if you could have gotten your druthers

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:42.782
to have the Fox News anchors and

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:46.953
folks on air say you know what, we lied

00:04:46.953 --> 00:04:47.920
or at least

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:50.523
bit having to have them to have them

00:04:50.757 --> 00:04:51.691
have to make a statement?

00:04:51.691 --> 00:04:52.692
Would you prefer that

00:04:55.028 --> 00:04:56.763
It's always bittersweet when

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:58.164
you settle a case

00:04:58.164 --> 00:05:00.466
because you think you have a great case.

00:05:01.034 --> 00:05:01.801
The issue is,

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:03.169
of course, that there's always risk in

00:05:03.169 --> 00:05:04.904
going to a jury trial.

00:05:04.904 --> 00:05:07.173
And my client, really

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.075
these employees of Dominion

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:11.611
have been so incredibly harmed

00:05:12.211 --> 00:05:15.381
and they still get threats, death

00:05:15.381 --> 00:05:16.149
threats.

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:17.750
They it's really difficult

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.218
for the company to be operating.

00:05:19.218 --> 00:05:21.354
And so for them to have this settlement

00:05:21.354 --> 00:05:24.190
really does mean a lot And remember,

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:25.558
this is just the first step.

00:05:25.558 --> 00:05:26.225
We have six

00:05:26.225 --> 00:05:29.295
other cases against other defendants

00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:30.363
who are

00:05:30.363 --> 00:05:30.930
some of them

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.965
are still lying about the election.

00:05:32.965 --> 00:05:34.500
And so what we think

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.668
and we're really proud of

00:05:35.668 --> 00:05:36.769
is that this really is

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:38.371
the first time that someone has been held

00:05:38.371 --> 00:05:40.239
accountable for the results

00:05:40.239 --> 00:05:41.341
and the lies that we're told

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:43.142
after the 20, 20 election

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:45.011
Other defendants who might that be

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.182
Well, we have a case against Newsmax.

00:05:49.182 --> 00:05:51.184
We have a case against one American news.

00:05:51.451 --> 00:05:52.185
And then of course,

00:05:52.185 --> 00:05:54.320
we have cases against Sidney Powell

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:56.189
and Mike Lindell and Mypillow

00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:58.891
and Rudy Giuliani and Patrick Byrne.

00:05:59.759 --> 00:06:01.961
And so we think that

00:06:02.228 --> 00:06:03.062
we will continue

00:06:03.062 --> 00:06:04.364
to hold people accountable

00:06:04.364 --> 00:06:05.698
for the lies that they told.

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:06.399
I mean, look,

00:06:06.399 --> 00:06:07.667
ultimately misinformation

00:06:07.667 --> 00:06:09.202
is not going away.

00:06:09.202 --> 00:06:11.771
The truth does not know red or blue.

00:06:11.971 --> 00:06:14.040
And what we have to do

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:14.640
is really

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.242
if we're going to have this

00:06:16.242 --> 00:06:18.378
shared experiment in democracy,

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:20.613
we have to have a common commitment

00:06:21.114 --> 00:06:22.315
to facts.

00:06:22.315 --> 00:06:23.983
And we can disagree.

00:06:23.983 --> 00:06:25.451
We can have different opinions,

00:06:25.451 --> 00:06:27.787
even on our most profound issues.

00:06:27.787 --> 00:06:31.090
But if we are not able to agree on facts,

00:06:31.457 --> 00:06:32.492
then that is

00:06:32.492 --> 00:06:33.593
when we're going to have these

00:06:33.593 --> 00:06:35.161
just bubbles of what

00:06:35.161 --> 00:06:36.729
we don't talk to each other.

00:06:36.729 --> 00:06:38.030
And what happened to Dominion

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:39.098
is it just got swept

00:06:39.098 --> 00:06:41.167
in this torrent of lies

00:06:41.534 --> 00:06:42.568
where it was

00:06:42.568 --> 00:06:44.637
in this alternative universe.

00:06:44.637 --> 00:06:46.639
And I do hope that this really does

00:06:46.639 --> 00:06:47.974
send a message

00:06:47.974 --> 00:06:50.143
that it is so, so important

00:06:50.143 --> 00:06:51.511
to tell the truth

00:06:51.511 --> 00:06:53.012
and that if you don't tell

00:06:53.012 --> 00:06:55.081
the truth, lies have consequences.

00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:56.749
And I think this is what it established.

00:06:56.749 --> 00:06:58.050
And that is why

00:06:58.050 --> 00:06:59.285
there is accountability today.

00:06:59.285 --> 00:07:01.454
There's accountability to dominion

00:07:01.454 --> 00:07:03.356
and there's accountability to democracy.

00:07:05.725 --> 00:07:06.559
Justin.

00:07:06.626 --> 00:07:08.294
Former Fox News anchor Gretchen

00:07:08.294 --> 00:07:10.129
Carlson tweeted a few days ago.

00:07:10.129 --> 00:07:11.230
Please do not settle.

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:12.598
You are about to prove something

00:07:12.598 --> 00:07:13.232
very big.

00:07:13.232 --> 00:07:14.500
She, of course, was successful

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:15.601
not only against

00:07:15.601 --> 00:07:17.103
in her litigation against Fox News,

00:07:17.103 --> 00:07:18.838
but in arbitration,

00:07:18.838 --> 00:07:20.206
but in changing the law

00:07:20.206 --> 00:07:21.240
when it comes to secret

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.708
mandatory arbitration.

00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:23.643
I just wonder

00:07:23.643 --> 00:07:25.878
if there are things about Fox as lies

00:07:26.078 --> 00:07:27.880
and how they conducted themselves

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.449
behind closed doors.

00:07:29.449 --> 00:07:31.451
But now the public will not know

00:07:31.451 --> 00:07:32.485
because there has been

00:07:32.485 --> 00:07:34.620
there will be no trial

00:07:36.422 --> 00:07:37.557
Well,

00:07:37.557 --> 00:07:38.791
I think that what you saw

00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:39.258
in the past

00:07:39.258 --> 00:07:39.959
couple of months

00:07:39.959 --> 00:07:41.394
that has come out

00:07:41.394 --> 00:07:43.596
in our summary judgment briefing

00:07:43.596 --> 00:07:44.430
and that already is

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.599
public, has really revealed

00:07:46.599 --> 00:07:50.236
behind the scenes that Fox did know

00:07:50.236 --> 00:07:51.404
that these were lies.

00:07:51.404 --> 00:07:53.005
That was a really big question.

00:07:53.005 --> 00:07:54.340
Going into this.

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:56.375
Did Fox really know it?

00:07:56.375 --> 00:07:57.710
Did the anchors who are saying

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.011
it really believe it?

00:07:59.011 --> 00:08:00.780
And I think that we've seen the evidence.

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:01.681
We've seen the evidence

00:08:01.681 --> 00:08:03.883
from these crazy emails

00:08:03.883 --> 00:08:05.818
that started it all to people

00:08:05.818 --> 00:08:08.588
saying that Sidney Powell was lying to

00:08:09.255 --> 00:08:10.790
the motive that occurred.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.525
And this was all in black and white

00:08:12.525 --> 00:08:14.694
and documents that have been revealed.

00:08:14.694 --> 00:08:15.561
So would

00:08:15.561 --> 00:08:17.563
the trial have put on that same evidence?

00:08:17.563 --> 00:08:18.931
Of course.

00:08:18.931 --> 00:08:20.733
But at the end of the day,

00:08:20.733 --> 00:08:22.368
I think the accountability came

00:08:22.368 --> 00:08:23.903
from what already has happened

00:08:23.903 --> 00:08:25.304
over the last months.

00:08:25.304 --> 00:08:27.807
And, of course, the payment itself,

00:08:27.807 --> 00:08:30.243
having a nearly $800 million payment,

00:08:30.543 --> 00:08:32.545
really, I think sends a strong message

00:08:32.545 --> 00:08:33.913
about what it means to lie.

00:08:33.913 --> 00:08:35.781
Justin Nelson, thank you for your time.

00:08:35.781 --> 00:08:36.716
We'll be following those,

00:08:36.716 --> 00:08:38.017
I think six other cases

00:08:38.017 --> 00:08:38.851
that you are

00:08:38.851 --> 00:08:39.619
lead counsel

00:08:39.619 --> 00:08:41.888
in as well as this progresses.

00:08:41.888 --> 00:08:44.223
Thanks very, very much Thanks, Justin.

00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:46.058
Thank you very much.

00:08:46.058 --> 00:08:46.559
Appreciate it.

